  "notes": "C1b Track B pilot (methodology v2.0 section 2): the production-v4 profile (P1, grounding crops, zoomed second look; no caption pass, tracking or set-of-marks) on the local experiment agent for Cosmos 3 Nano and Super; 25 dev clips x 1 repeat = 25 /analyze runs per subject, 50 in all. Dev only (purpose pilot). budget_mode hard_stop: the run-wide token caps sum to the owner-approved 9 M tokens (inference 2 M, grounding 2.5 M, zoom 4.5 M; each subject half of each), below the profile's worst case; every run holds its worst case (70 k + 240 k + 320 k tokens) before it is sent and is refused when a cap cannot cover it. Typical use is about 1.4 M tokens. It calibrates the provisional crop and zoom caps (tasks/pipeline/crops.py cap_summary). The judge cap is this run's share of the approved judge budget. Readiness: methodology/v2-run-readiness.md.",
